he does, and we've talked before about MAGA&nbsp;
really means making attorneys get attorneys.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:13.560
That's been a theme as well. The smartest&nbsp;
possible interpretation of this entire lawyer&nbsp;&nbsp;

