There is that's the that's the most generous&nbsp;
interpretation. There is absolutely no evidence&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:41.280
that that's actually what's going on. This is&nbsp;
a wild situation where Trump is struggling to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:46.680
find lawyers. Even hours before today's court&nbsp;
appearance will be live for the arraignment&nbsp;&nbsp;

